<title>MEXICO: Salomon hires Mullin to head Latam Equity team.</title>
<headline>Salomon hires Mullin to head Latam Equity team.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc brokerage unit Salomon Brothers Inc announced Tuesday it appointed John Mullin as Vice President, Latin American Equity Strategist.</p>
<p>Mullin was previously Vice President in the Global Asset Allocation group of Travelers Group Inc unit Smith Barney.  Before that he was Senior Economist at the Federal Reserve Bank of New York in the International Finance Department.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
